msgstr "Important safety information"

msgid "Vega — donorlarni muvofiqlashtirish platformasi."
msgstr "Vega is a donor coordination platform."

msgid ""
"Vega biror shaxsning qon topshirishga tibbiy jihatdan mos yoki mos "
"emasligini aniqlamaydi."
msgstr ""
"Vega does not determine whether a person is medically eligible to donate "
"blood."

msgid ""
"Vega tomonidan ko'rsatilgan potentsial moslik donorlik xavfsiz, maqsadga "
"muvofiq yoki tibbiy jihatdan mumkin ekanligini kafolatlamaydi."
msgstr ""
"A potential match shown by Vega does not guarantee that donation is safe, "
"appropriate, or medically possible."

msgid ""
"Donorlar malakali tibbiyot xodimlarining ko'rsatmalariga amal qilishlari "
"shart."
msgstr ""
"Donors must follow the instructions of qualified medical professionals."

msgid "Yakuniy tibbiy qarorni faqat qon markazi xodimlari qabul qiladi."
msgstr "The final medical decision is made only by blood center staff."

msgid "Xavfsizlik"
msgstr "Safety"

msgid "Hozir faol"
